Yeah! Even with things I had no idea about at all, when I'm streaming, the viewers will teach me about them, and...

537
00:31:43,509 --> 00:31:44,809
うんうんうん
Mm-hmm.

538
00:31:45,009 --> 00:31:49,509
なんか全然知らないところの知識をこう、吸収できたり
